# Keep the Docker build context lean and never copy host build artifacts into
# the image (the build stage restores + publishes from clean source).
**/bin/
**/obj/
.git/
.github/
.vs/
.idea/
# Claude Code session data + git worktrees — never build input; a stale worktree
# here is a second full repo copy that would otherwise bloat the build context.
.claude/
**/TestResults/
artifacts/
*.user
